// =============================================================================
// Network Service - OVS Bridge and Libvirt Network Management
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Manages virtual networks on hypervisor nodes including OVS (Open
// vSwitch) bridges/ports and libvirt networks.
//
// Communication: Unary RPC for all operations
//
// Key Components:
// - OVS Bridge: Virtual switches for VM networking
// - OVS Port: Network ports on bridges (with VLAN support)
// - OVS QoS: Quality of Service rules for traffic shaping
// - Libvirt Network: NAT, bridge, isolated network modes with DHCP
// - Flow Management: OpenFlow rules for network programming
// - Sync from Director: Networks/ports created by Director sync to agents
//
// Network Types (libvirt): nat, bridge, isolated, passthrough
// =============================================================================

